### 11.1 Emission Reductions

The mini-grid displaces fossil-fuel self-generation (diesel and petrol/PMS generators) that would otherwise serve the community's electricity needs. Nigeria has an estimated 22 million petrol generators; emission reductions are calculated based on displaced diesel and PMS consumption using IPCC Tier 2 emission factors.

